# The FX pages' views: the chain along the top (this page lit, a bar under each effect whose Mix is up),
# and each page's picture drawn from its settings: the shaper's curve (Type, Drive) and the sine after it
# (Tone); the modulation's sweep (Type, Depth); the echoes (Mix, Time, Ping-pong, Tape's darkening), lit as
# they sound; the reverb's tail (Decay), a note feeding it and the marker after; the room (Size, Shimmer)
# and Low end. Grey while the effect's Mix is 0; nothing redrawn while nothing changes. Light, then Dark.
# (colX_Y: the theme colour at a pixel, 1 panel 2 line 3 dim 5 white 6 accent 8 blue, -1 none of them;
# topX_C / botX_C: the top / bottom row of column X in that colour)
wait 200
tap FX
expect view 16
wait 50
# the chain: DIST lit, MOD not; Distortion's Mix at 0: no bar, the curve grey; the reverb's Mix 3: a stub
expect col9_38 6
expect col67_38 1
expect col10_45 6
expect col68_112 3
expect col193_45 6
expect col196_45 1
shot dist_light.png
expect stale 0
# still: nothing redrawn
expect blits >-1
wait 1000
expect blits 0
spin K2 25
wait 50
expect col10_45 5
expect col68_112 8
# Tone: open, the sine after it squared off to the top; closed, rounded and lower
spin K4 40
wait 50
expect top150_6 131
spin K4 -100
wait 50
expect top150_6 >138
spin K4 60
# Distort clipped at Drive 40 a quarter of the way out, at Drive 0 the line; Fuzz flat at 0.6 above; Fold
# turned back over
spin K1 1
wait 50
expect top91_8 66
spin K3 -40
wait 50
expect top91_8 89
spin K3 40
spin K1 1
wait 50
expect top91_8 84
expect bot45_8 >130
spin K1 1
wait 50
expect top91_8 102
spin K1 -3
# a note: the dot where its level lands, moving no faster than every 32 ms
midi 90 45 64
breath 0 120 50
wait 300
expect top114_6 75
expect blits >-1
wait 1000
expect blits <34
midi 80 45 00
breath 120 0 20
wait 100
